Attribution for windows.mjs
===========================

Adapted from prismarine-windows 2.10.0, index.js and lib/Window.js.
https://github.com/PrismarineJS/prismarine-windows

The adaptation specializes PC Minecraft 1.21.1, accepts the bundled Item class,
uses events 3.3.0 instead of a Node built-in, and corrects the named defects
listed in windows.mjs and independently checked by the reference scenarios.
No native Minecraft source has been copied into this module.

The installed npm package declares MIT but supplies no LICENSE file or
separate copyright notice. Its original license and author declarations
are retained verbatim below; no copyright holder or year is invented.
The events dependency retains its own MIT license in the bundled distribution.

----- prismarine-windows/package.json -----

